#N canvas 80 80 640 513 12;
#X text 20 10 moving_average <n>: average of the last n numbers (default 16) \, like zexy's [mavg]. Starts from zeros \, so it eases in. Ring buffer of n values and a running sum: sum = sum + new - oldest.;
